### Check first
Open [this component](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/highlights) and its [metrics](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/metrics). Check P99 search latency, loaded indexes, search parameters and query-node resources. The configured threshold is **{{threshold}}** in the monitor chart's unit.

### Likely causes
Unloaded indexes, large search breadth or query-node contention.

### Fix
Load the intended indexes and tune search parameters within the required recall budget.

### Verify
P99 search latency returns below the threshold under representative searches. If samples are absent, investigate the exporter and Collector: this threshold check cannot establish healthy operation without data.
